EnableDruidClasses.master.patch: the Druid line (Druid, Karnos, Alitea) for a fresh rAthena,
for WARP0716's "Enable Druid classes (2026)" client patch.

Updated 2026-11-06. Check for further updates here: https://warp.legacygamers.net/warp0716/EnableDruidClasses/

For a fresh rAthena (plain master), which does not have the Druid line. From the root of the tree:
    git apply --check EnableDruidClasses.master.patch
    git apply         EnableDruidClasses.master.patch
then rebuild the servers. Already applied an earlier copy of this file? The guide has an update
file for it, or undo the old copy (git apply -R) and apply this one.

The Druid line's server code is datawulf's, open upstream as rathena/rathena#9765
(https://github.com/datawulf/rathena, branch codex/kro-alitea). Its commits are by Atemo, Lemongrass3110, Muh, munkrej.
WARP0716 packages it for a fresh rAthena, with its own changes on top: the transformation effect plays when the form starts; skill costs and ranges as kRO 2026-10-07; Nature Rage and Plume Piercer send the skill-used packet, so their effects show.

Made from rAthena master d4b8e7b8f 2026-10-06 + datawulf codex/kro-alitea bce67cc07 2026-10-16 + WARP0716's changes a953366965277bb5.
138 files changed, 10060 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-). rAthena and these changes are GNU GPL v3; so is this file.

